      "x": 1450, "y": 945, "width": 340, "height": 50,
      "text": "Deps: []. Creates the MapLibre map (CartoDB Positron,\nEurope-locked maxBounds), attaches MapboxOverlay\n(deck.gl), boosts country/region label styling.",
